{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_blitz_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_blitz_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "团队坚盾",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_blitz_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5cb7383ba0192cbbe752d9df4b998c4aab3fca0f16447bba5262eccdd1f9647a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萨尔贡\n焚风热土边境"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "您好，先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "先生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "一边儿去，没力气和你搭话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "您能卖些水和吃的给我吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "（眯眼观察闪击）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "哟，原来是雇佣兵老爷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "我们村里除了热风和沙子可啥都没有，你来干什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "我准备去南方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "去南方？哈，我看你是热昏了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "那可是焚风热土。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "我就是去焚风热土。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "（重新打量了一遍闪击）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "我看你精神不错，没受什么打击，去那寻死干什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "就是去看看，探索一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "我猜猜，其他人是不是把你当疯子给赶走了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "是这样没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "那你找我干什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "买些补给。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "佣兵大老爷啊，在这村里一口水一口粮都是命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "钱可不顶用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "我听其他村民说，你负责和别村的人做生意，没错吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "哈，谁会来这种地方买东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "（萨尔贡俚语）我想买“三枚金币”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "（不通顺的维多利亚语）我需要蛋糕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "（萨尔贡俚语）给你一粒黄沙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "哼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "屋里说话吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "欢迎来到罗德岛安全屋，干员。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "呃，你们这帮人是叫干员，对吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "是的，没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "你需要些什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "尽可能多的干粮和水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "你真要进焚风热土？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "我在这鬼地方待了四十多年，从来没见人会对那地方感兴趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "从那儿刮来的热风每年都会带走不少人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "至于剩下的，你也看到了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "每天在门外一动不动吹风乘凉，说句话都嫌累。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "要不是我还会做点买卖，和外面有那么点接触，我这辈子也就那样了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "但去看一眼总归没什么损失，是吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "也就你们外乡人会感兴趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "等下，我这有个之前你们罗德岛的人留下的东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "你先喝口水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "谢谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "啊，找到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "第一次有人委托我搞这个什么——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "（口音浓重的维多利亚语）“安全屋”的时候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "他们给想要去热土的人留了份须知。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "我不识字，你自己看吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "谢谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "（标准维多利亚语）不建议探索焚风热土，若一定要进入请务必确认带足生存资源。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "这上面写了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "建议我带足补给再进去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "也不知道你为什么那么固执，要去那鬼地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "啧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "这样吧，水和物资我这里有，按照那什么规定本来就是要给你们干员的，你自己拿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "刚刚的水喝了没有？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "有什么感觉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "脑袋好像不那么涨了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "那就对咯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "这东西我会放一水壶，你觉得脑袋不舒服了就抿一口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "但别一口气喝太多，会产生幻觉的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "谢谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "一共一枚金币。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "一枚金币？好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "呃？不，兄弟我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "我回来的时候可能得麻烦你买只驮兽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "可这——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "再买些回程的补给，剩下还有多的就麻烦你随便买些特产了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "行吧行吧，外乡人花钱都阔气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "你是在这睡一宿还是有其他安排？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "现在就出发。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "行吧兄弟，我也不留你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "对了，怎么称呼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "闪击。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "焚风热土，闪击萨尔贡之旅的最后一站。\n迎接他的是炎热、狂风与沙粒。\n对于泰拉人而言，无尽黄沙，炽热风暴，那就是大地尽头的样貌。\n但在闪击眼中，它却是探索的起点，只要足够坚韧，再加上一些好运气，它或许会为探险家展现真相。\n既然这片沙漠尚无人探索，这里就拥有些微小的可能性。\n万一其中包含了回家的方法呢？\n闪击决定试一试。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "就这样，我进入了热土，然后完好无损地回来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "勇气可嘉，兄弟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "我应该对泰拉各个危险区域做过重点标注。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "你们倒好，全部去了个遍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "哼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "所以，焚风热土有什么发现吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "我很希望自己能说出些好消息，但那个地方只有沙子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "战车、霜华，我听说北方冰原那里有很多怪东西，对吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "霜华对付过那些怪物，很难缠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "我真希望能和些有形的东西战斗，至少能证实那里还有生命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "但在焚风热土。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "天空、狂风、沙子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "这就是一切了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "那里应该不太适合旅游。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "很无趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "也很孤单，闪击这样想到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "说起来，你跑到萨尔贡探险，有去拜访我们的老朋友吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "老朋友？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "啊，是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "嗯......你是说长泉镇的新领主小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "嗯哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "她最近过得还不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "处理完那些烦人的怪物之后，新的哥伦比亚公司找上了她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "听上去不像是什么好事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "梅兰德？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "梅兰德。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "对方给出了很优渥的条件，但因为之前沃尔沃特科钦斯基闹出的麻烦，皮加尔还是拒绝了许多条款，只确定了最基本的贸易合作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "有意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "长泉镇之前的资金来源主要是出售源石矿，但深层矿场早已封闭，浅层矿场也在那时候被我们爆破，不存在继续出产矿石的可能性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "他们还能贩卖什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "这还得感谢我们的亚历山大先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "跟我有什么关系？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "你在那儿闲着无聊，做了很多俄罗斯套娃吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "是这样没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "听说去考察的哥伦比亚人很喜欢这种“萨尔贡”工艺品，梅兰德的人找皮加尔要了独家代理权。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "这......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "这太荒唐了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "当地人摇身一变，全成了萨尔贡的“传统”手艺人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "然后领主小姐拿这第一桶金找哥伦比亚人买了适宜在荒漠生长的粮食种子，还把镇子翻新了一遍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "顺带一提，老领主的宅子被皮加尔修成花园了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "以我们的眼光来看，她做得还不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "哼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "那——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "——米亚罗医生的墓，还在吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "......墓石一直在被风沙侵蚀，已经有些崩落了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "......我帮他擦了墓碑，献了一束花，然后请当地人做了个小防风棚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "我想他在另外一个世界过得很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "好，那很不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "咳嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "总体来说，萨尔贡是个有趣的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "他们的语言发展情况，和我去过的其他国家都大不相同。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "即使是同一个地区的人，都会因为种族差异而带有不同的口音。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "有些音调只在特定的种族中出现，其他种族的人几乎没有复现的可能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "除非，他们变成蜥蜴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "或是其他什么奇怪生物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "text": "你的关注点很特别。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "这是我的专业。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "说到语言，我在萨尔贡路过了一个很特别的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "阿卡胡拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "text": "阿......卡......呼......啦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "是阿卡胡拉，医疗部那位阿达克利斯女士的老家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "嘉维尔，我听说过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "我没想到在萨尔贡还能找到这样一个天堂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "可惜，那里的阿达克利斯“热情过度”，能用拳头交流都懒得动口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "最后盾牌使用频率过高，嘣！坏了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "在离开阿卡胡拉前，我只能暂时用木材加闪光弹制造了一块盾牌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "text": "很有趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "雨林里有不少独特的猎物，蒂娜你会喜欢那里的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "用餐时间差不多到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "各位下午有什么安排？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "我想我可能得去人事部搞套新制服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "萨尔贡的沙子算是把整套制服都给毁了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "再穿着它，我甚至没法隐蔽自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "是个人都能沿着一路落下的沙砾找到我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "真是灾难。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "那么，两小时后，罗德岛训练场集合，各位没有意见吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "众人",
      "text": "没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "我们已经很久没有作为一支小队进行日常训练了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "希望各位还记得对抗演习的要点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "解散，两小时后见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "回见，各位。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "行动起来吧，库兹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "今天还有许多任务等待着你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "罗德岛\n彩虹小队临时宿舍"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "新制服、新装备，这下就差不多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "让我看看——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "闪击看着宿舍镜子中的自己。\n在这段时间里，他独自一人游历萨尔贡，寻找着回家的线索。\n从萨尔贡或繁荣或颓废的城市，到阿卡胡拉茂密的丛林，没有地方能阻拦他探索的脚步。\n但焚风热土是个例外。\n在那里，似乎时间都被黄沙支配。\n一天，两天，十天。\n眼前的景色从来没有变化过。\n就那么在沙中踏步。\n一无所获。\n他害怕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他也不清楚自己是何时下定决心返回的，在那段时间里，前进与后退似乎没有区别。\n直到回到那个热土边境的安全屋时，生存的知觉才回到身体上。\n紧接着，就是如潮水般涌来的疲惫。\n每次想起，都感到后怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "怎么样，状态还好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "一会请你枪子吃个够。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "那我先过去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "（拍拍闪击的肩膀）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "熟悉的声音把他从回忆拉回现实。\n他看着自己手中那把改造铳，还有充满电能的盾牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "对抗演习，应该是我和灰烬对付霜华和战车吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "合作，对抗，与战友共同达成战术目标。\n他突然觉得心中充满了干劲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "该给他们个惊喜了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "四小时后\n罗德岛本舰训练场"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "呼，哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "曾有那么一刻，他想过把探索热土的路走到尽头。不成功便成仁。\n但在某一天，多喝了一口安全屋兄弟送的神秘饮料，处于清醒与迷幻的间隙中时，他突然意识到一点：\n自己举盾冲刺，迫切地想要获得成果。\n却把自己的队友们远远甩在了身后。\n伊莱亚斯·库兹，干员闪击。\n职责是护卫队友。\n给霜华创造布陷机会。\n把敌人引向战车的枪前。\n为灰烬提供一些建议。\n而非一人独行，涉险探索。\n他明白了。\n所以现在，他回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "我都快忘记上一次踩中踏垫是什么感觉了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "谢天谢地，霜华，你没有拿对付怪物的陷阱对付我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "text": "把感谢留给灰烬吧，没有那发榴弹你本该出局的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "这毕竟只是二对二对抗训练，许多要素要比实际情况简单。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "亚历山大的设防位置我已经用无人机确认过多次，所以才敢冒险。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "如果使用的不是训练弹，你没有机会的，灰烬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "我明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "所以我钻了这个空子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "希望我们四个一下子消失，没把艾拉双月她们一起卷进来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "但愿如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "很可惜，我们再也没法凑成一支完整的五人特种小队了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "有没有考虑过在这片大地上招募点新人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "我们是反恐特种部队成员，不是军事承包商手底下的雇佣兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "维护和平是，曾经是，我们唯一的任务。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "很可惜，这里的和平比地球的还要脆弱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "所以，现在我们要做的，是生存，还有寻找回家的路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "无论有多少新鲜血液，他们都不会和我们一起把这条路走到尽头的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "嗯哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "但这种差别，真的有那么大吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "比我们各自的祖国之间的区别还要大？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "以前有老上司六号给我们擦屁股，现在呢，一切都看我们自己的了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "或许你可以尝试着让自己融入这个世界，灰烬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "我们离开熟悉的环境很久了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "但适应这里之后，或许会觉得这个糟糕的地方，可能还有些可取之处。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "回家很重要，但那不是全部，科恩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "在找到回家的路之前，或许可以先想想，怎么去生活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "怎么样可以让我们放下枪之后，还能行走在这片大地上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "这就是你的想法？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "只是一个建议。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "来自朋友的建议。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "我会考虑的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "有人来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "好久不见，彩虹小队的各位干员。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "欢迎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "欢迎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "等等，灰烬，这是怎么回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "我们也是来训练的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "法伦",
      "text": "或者说，是来接受培训的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格瑞斯",
      "text": "各位好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "既然新的对手就位了，那让我们开始吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "灰烬，你不会是想......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "我们是干员，我们是彩虹小队。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "希望各位能够接受这场挑战。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "我接受。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "text": "那我得换种踏垫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "你呢，闪击？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "答案显而易见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "拒绝可不是我的选项，灰烬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "我准备好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
